# Button system (header banner tokens)

Match header quick-action chips for all page CTAs.

## Create / primary (“Yeni … Oluştur”, Kaydet primary, BTN_PRIMARY, `btn-primary`)

- Gradient: `from-[#8ad9ff] via-[#60a5fa] to-[#3b82f6]` (CSS vars `--bach-btn-create-*`)
- Height: **52px** (`--ds-control-h: 3.25rem`)
- Radius: `rounded-xl` (12px)
- Shadow: `0 8px 20px -12px rgba(30,35,60,0.55)`
- White bold label

## Cancel / Vazgeç (`btn-cancel`, Button `variant="cancel"|"danger"`)

- Gradient: `from-[#fda4af] via-[#f43f5e] to-[#e11d48]` (same as “Yeni Alış Faturası” chip)
- Same height/radius/shadow as create buttons
- White bold label

## Açılır yeni oluştur butonu (REQUIRED)

When the user asks for **açılır yeni oluştur butonu**, or any page-header “Yeni … Oluştur” with options:

- Always use `src/components/Common/SplitCreateButton.jsx`
- Visual model (do not reinvent):
  - Single shell: `.btn-split` (one body, shared shadow/radius)
  - Full-height white divider: `.btn-split-divider`
  - Whole control lifts on hover like header chips (`translateY(-2px)`)
  - Dropdown opens below, `z-[120]`, above page panels (page header uses `z-30`)
- Menu pattern: primary action + at least one option (e.g. “Müşteri Seçerek Oluştur”, “Hızlı Taslak”)
- Customer pick: `CreateCustomerPickModal` + `customerToDocumentPatch` when prefill is needed

Reference implementation: Satış Faturaları (`SalesInvoicesPage`) and Süreç Yönetimi pages (Teklifler, Siparişler, Üretim, Depo, Teslim Edilenler).

## Page header height

`.app-page-header` matches the cash quick-actions strip (`.app-header-banner`):
`min-h-[4.75rem]`, `px-4 py-3 sm:px-6`, centered flex row, `overflow-visible`, `z-30`.

## Rules for new UI

- Prefer `btn-primary` / `btn-cancel` or `@bachmain/ui` Button primary/cancel
- Prefer `SplitCreateButton` for create CTAs with options — never two separate rounded buttons side by side
- Do not invent flat navy primary or gray text-only Vazgeç for page-level CTAs
- Icon-only micro controls may stay smaller; page header and form footer actions use 52px
